.TH ORO-WINDOW-APPEARANCE 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:window/appearance \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:window/appearance'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Android inset and predictive Back observations for the current window.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBonInsetsChange(callback)\fR
Observes changes after `ApplicationWindow.setSystemAppearance()` selects an inset owner. An `end` event also covers interrupted platform IME animations; use the reported inset values as the current state, not the target fraction.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIcallback\fR ((insets: WindowInsets) => void; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fI() => void\fR Unsubscribe.
.TP
\fBonBackGesture(callback)\fR
Observes the runtime activity's Back callback. Progress requires Android 14+. Start/progress/cancel never navigate; commit follows native history/activity handling. This observation does not intercept Back or replace an application's modal/drawer dismissal priority. Custom native callbacks must forward events.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIcallback\fR ((gesture: BackGesture) => void; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fI() => void\fR Unsubscribe.
